      "message": "The issue I encountered is, I would like declare the three hook functions below in v4l2core.h and it build fail. But its no problem if I declare those in v4l2mc.h(see patch set 5).\n\nDECLARE_RESTRICTED_HOOK(android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_selection,...);\nDECLARE_RESTRICTED_HOOK(android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_fmt,...);\nDECLARE_RESTRICTED_HOOK(android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_frame_interval,...);\n\n\n\nIt build fail in latest ACK android12-5.10 when I do upstream check.\n\nfail message,\n\tLine 4559: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:30:1: error: redefinition of \u0027trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_selection\u0027\n\tLine 4587: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:30:1: error: redefinition of \u0027trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_selection_enabled\u0027\n\tLine 4615: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:30:1: error: redefinition of \u0027register_trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_selection\u0027\n\tLine 4643: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:36:1: error: redefinition of \u0027trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_fmt\u0027\n\tLine 4672: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:36:1: error: redefinition of \u0027trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_fmt_enabled\u0027\n\tLine 4700: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:36:1: error: redefinition of \u0027register_trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_fmt\u0027\n\tLine 4728: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:42:1: error: redefinition of \u0027trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_frame_interval\u0027\n\tLine 4756: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:42:1: error: redefinition of \u0027trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_frame_interval_enabled\u0027\n\tLine 4784: ../include/trace/hooks/v4l2core.h:42:1: error: redefinition of \u0027register_trace_android_rvh_v4l2subdev_set_frame_interval\u0027",
