      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was caused by incorrect header inclusion protection in v4l2core.h:\n```\n-#if !defined(_TRACE_HOOK_V4L2CORE_H) || defined(TRACE_HEADER_MULTI_READ)\n+#if !defined(_TRACE_HOOK_V4L2_CORE_H) || defined(TRACE_HEADER_MULTI_READ)\n #define _TRACE_HOOK_V4L2_CORE_H\n```\n\nIf you make this change, defining the rvh hooks in v4l2core.h builds fine.",
